	<ul>
		<li><strong>writeups</strong> — retired htb and ctf boxes. mostly the ones that taught me something i didn't know going in.</li>
		<li><strong>exploits</strong> — vulns i've found in real software, with pocs. nothing goes up before disclosure.</li>
		<li><strong>research</strong> — longer-form stuff. deep dives, weird techniques, things i figured out the hard way and wrote down so i don't have to figure them out again.</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
